<title>USA: D.R. Horton increases credit facility.</title>
<headline>D.R. Horton increases credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.R. Horton Inc said Monday that its unsecured bank credit facility has been increased to $625 million from $400 million.</p>
<p>The member bank facility was led by NationsBank, Bank of America and Fleet National Bank.</p>
<p>In a press release,, Horton said the credit facility consists of a $200 million five-year term loan, a $400 million four-year revolving loan facility and a $25 million four-year letter of credit facility.</p>
